  "question": {
    "text": "A particle moves along a straight line with a variable acceleration given in the acceleration-displacement <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> curve as shown in the figure. Determine the velocity (in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>) of the particle after it has travelled a distance of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>30</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The initial velocity is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>m&#160;</mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>.<br />\r&nbsp;\r<img alt=\"Picture 513\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/zzzzzzzzz1212.JPG\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 158px;\" />",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "20",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img alt=\"Picture 513\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/zzzzzzzzz1212.JPG\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 158px;\" /><br /><br />Area under curve is <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></math> ……..(i)<br />Area under the curve is also equal to <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> …….(ii)<br />From (i) and (ii)<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>150</mn></math><br /><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=300</mo></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>300</mn></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>300</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>400</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mtext>m&nbsp;</mtext><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
